        "tree": {
            "0": {
                "emotion": "greeting",
                "text": "Oh, Ma’at, take me from this heat… Wait a minute...You there! Are you the new servant?"
            },
            "1": {
                "text": "Thank the goddess, you’ve arrived! The skin beneath my folds is quite hot and bothered. I believe I’m due for a good scrub. Ah yes, a nice soothing sponge bath..."
            },
            "2": {
                "emotion": "hmph",
                "text": "Well? Chop chop! I don’t want any more bacteria growing down there!",
                "choices": {
                    "0": {
                        "text": "I’m not your servant.",
                        "tree": {
                            "0": {
                                "emotion": "afraid",
                                "text": "What’s that? Oh! Ah… erm… forget what you just heard then. I’m as clean as a… as a… well, as a clean thing!"
                            },
                            "1": {
                                "jumpPointName": "questions",
                                "text": "Speak up! Who are you? What do you want?",
                                "choices": {
                                    "0": {
                                        "text": "<c=lore>Tell me about this place.</c>",
                                        "tree": {
                                            "0": {
                                                "emotion": "explain",
                                                "text": "This place? You mean my encampment? Yes, well, this is the Rainforest station for the noble Order of Ma’at."
                                            },
                                            "1": {
                                                "goToJump": "questions",
                                                "text": "I am General Jethin, son of the esteemed Bishop Vahara who rules over the Architectural District in the great city of Elephantine."
                                            }
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "1": {
                                        "text": "<c=lore>You're a General?</c>",
                                        "tree": {
                                            "0": {
                                                "emotion": "explain",
                                                "text": "Excuse me? While it’s  true, I’m not as… able-bodied… as other Generals, nor am I as agile…"
                                            },
                                            "1": {
                                                "text": "And yes, it is also true that I can no longer walk in the marches… or anywhere for that matter… I’m an integral part of the Order’s military establishment!"
                                            },
                                            "2": {
                                                "emotion": "hmph",
                                                "text": "How dare you question my ability to perform my job. Why if I didn’t find these pillows so comfortable, I’d challenge you to a fight for such disrespect!"
                                            },
                                            "3": {
                                                "text": "Anyway, if I weren’t an important General, why would I have been trusted to look after this Encampment?",
                                                "choices": {
                                                    "0": {
                                                        "text": "What, this backwater place?",
                                                        "tree": {
                                                            "0": {
                                                                "emotion": "explain",
                                                                "text": "Oh, who am I kidding? You’re right. I was perfectly happy in Elephantine, indulging my finer self to all the pleasures the city had to offer."
                                                            },
                                                            "1": {
                                                                "text": "But I’m no fool. I saw my father’s coworkers whispering and laughing about me. Pointing their bony fingers in judgement. Next I knew, I was stuffed in a boat and shipped off to this sweltering garbage tip."
                                                            },
                                                            "2": {
                                                                "goToJump": "questions",
                                                                "emotion": "explain",
                                                                "text": "The heat here is unbearable! And the bugs! Oh, gods, the bugs!"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            }
                                        }
                                    },
                                    "2": {
                                        "text": "I work for Boss Ngathu.",
                                        "tree": {
                                            "0": {
                                                "emotion": "afraid",
                                                "text": "Oh no! Please, please don’t kill me! Please! I’ll do anything! ...Within reason. Oh gods, I knew it. I knew this would happen.",
                                                "choices": {
                                                    "0": {
                                                        "text": "Do you have the dram?",
                                                        "tree": {
                                                            "0": {
                                                                "emotion": "explain",
                                                                "text": "I do! I do! Only… Well, it’s in that big chest over there. The problem is, thieves stole the key to the damn thing. I don’t know why they took the key and not the chest, but they did!"
                                                            },
                                                            "1": {
                                                                "giveQuest": "jethin-box",
                                                                "text": "If you can open it, you’re welcome to pay my debt from its contents, there is more than enough in there to pay..."
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                }
                                            }
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "indicator": "quest"
